{"ID":"20240522082251-8lynht0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082251-8lynht0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082251-8lynht0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092641-n80lfup\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092704-dsra6vj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092704-dsra6vj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"近二十年的濕疹","type":"doc","updated":"20240522092704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522092641-n80lfup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-n80lfup","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名 王xx  姓別 男  出生年 65歲 來診日期2008.12.29"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-19mz08m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-19mz08m","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬季癢，濕疹，腰帶附近大腿內外側不固定有紅疹，晚上更明顯，得到此病已經近二十年了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-4d93omg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-4d93omg","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-f2rss2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-f2rss2d","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.睡眠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：因濕疹癢，夜尿2-3次，從無法一覺到天亮，睡眠品質不太好"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-x7gy3yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-x7gy3yl","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2..胃口"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：好"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-hgr8gmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-hgr8gmh","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.大便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：每日條便"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-5wfgpw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-5wfgpw0","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.小便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：清淡黃(白天尚好，晚上夜尿)"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-wk4qnyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-wk4qnyt","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5.口渴"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：無(3-5小時忘記喝水)，喜冷飲，常喝茶"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-eazs5fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-eazs5fo","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.問汗"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：出汗少(大量運動才會大量出汗)"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-mps3en3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-mps3en3","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.手足溫度"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：腳溫                            "}]},{"ID":"20240522092650-14trhk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092650-14trhk7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8.掌額溫度"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-05qiwwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-05qiwwa","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9.體力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：好                                  "}]},{"ID":"20240522092651-lvyknig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092651-lvyknig"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.身體寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：不怕冷"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-7t9sacz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-7t9sacz","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 裡濕甚，皮下水多，無法汰舊水，換新水==\u003e麻黃加术湯，五苓散加減"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-mikr5bs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-mikr5bs","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-0bi8yxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-0bi8yxx","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-gkfym6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-gkfym6f","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃3 杏仁4 炙甘草2 桂枝2 白术4 荊芥3 茯苓3 豬苓2  澤瀉3 細辛1 烏藥3"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-cjuiawz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-cjuiawz","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"連翹3 金銀花2 蟬蛻0.5"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-olwvv8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-olwvv8j","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5付， 6 → 2  早晚飯前 平日多食四神湯，飯後甜點加蔗糖/黑糖，不要用白砂糖"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-of3jaj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-of3jaj5","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說/備註："}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-2t9s3ok","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-2t9s3ok","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522092641-zc0pq2o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-zc0pq2o","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522092641-4xvg1s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-4xvg1s5","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1/7吃8付後明顯改善 (洗完澡不會癢，半夜不會癢，一覺到天亮)"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-u1zwh5i","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-u1zwh5i","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522092641-rc0j9gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-rc0j9gw","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1/13來電吃完15付，好了95%"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-jgcmqsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-jgcmqsc","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-ura4sqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-ura4sqb","updated":"20240522092644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評論 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-akrjg5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-akrjg5h","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    ㄧ般如果是西醫皮膚科專科醫師遇到這種皮膚病時，在使用其他藥物沒有治療效果之後都會使用類固醇類藥物，這樣做只會越治越壞，上面這位病人得病已經超過二十年以上，我保證西醫一定有給他用過類固醇，讀者可以從這一案例就知道，完全是無效的。這位病人經過我的學生使用經方治療後，病人恢復的速度可以如此之快，就已經證明經方的療效有多快，因為世上只有經方才是真正正確有效治療疾病的醫學，上面案例中的麻黃加朮湯與五苓散就是出自經方，傳之千年以上的方劑，使用過上億的人身上，至今仍然有效，這還需要去鑑定嗎? 請問誰又有資格來做鑑定呢? 由無法治病的醫師來替已經將病治好的方劑做鑑定，這是合理的嗎? 根本就是不要臉的行為，我這一位優秀的學生，讀者光是看他的診斷與治療速度就知道，他非常優秀。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-i0aokrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-i0aokrm","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  經方必須傳世，這是我輩的責任所在，讀者認為該如何呢?"}]},{"ID":"20240522092641-q18k1kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092641-q18k1kq","updated":"20240522092641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於台北2009年01月20日"}]},{"ID":"20240522092701-f3src0w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522092701-f3src0w"}},{"ID":"20240522092704-dsra6vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092704-dsra6vj"}}]}